DSH's theme plugin injects, under `@supports (corner-shape: superellipse(1.5))`, a universal rule
over `*`, `:before` and `:after`:

```css
:root { --dsw-corner-shape: superellipse(1.5) }
*, :before, :after { corner-shape: var(--dsw-corner-shape) }
```
